 r←effCoord ns
⍝ Effective Coord of an EWC object: its own, or its parent's while 'Inherit'.
⍝ Above the top-level object (the application namespace) EWC's default is 'Pixel'.
 r←'Pixel'
 :While ~0∊ns.⎕NC'Type' '_EWC_Name'
     :If 2=ns.⎕NC'Coord'
     :AndIf ~(⊂⎕C ns.Coord)∊'inherit' ''
         →0⊣r←ns.Coord
     :EndIf
     ns←ns.##
 :EndWhile
